1
00:00:00,105 --> 00:00:02,097
Sendirian, menahan sakit,

2
00:00:02,117 --> 00:00:03,506
bersandar pada sebatang pohon

3
00:00:03,526 --> 00:00:04,511
kurma.

4
00:00:04,531 --> 00:00:06,818
Lalu ia diminta melakukan hal

5
00:00:06,838 --> 00:00:08,041
yang terdengar mustahil:

6
00:00:08,061 --> 00:00:09,199
goyangkan pohon itu.

7
00:00:09,219 --> 00:00:11,315
Surah Maryam ayat enam belas.

8
00:00:11,335 --> 00:00:12,849
Maryam mengasingkan diri dari

9
00:00:12,869 --> 00:00:14,563
keluarganya ke suatu tempat di

10
00:00:14,583 --> 00:00:15,431
sebelah timur.

11
00:00:15,451 --> 00:00:16,545
Di sana ia diberi kabar akan

12
00:00:16,565 --> 00:00:17,583
mengandung seorang anak

13
00:00:17,603 --> 00:00:18,775
laki-laki yang suci.

14
00:00:18,795 --> 00:00:19,848
Ia bertanya:

15
00:00:19,868 --> 00:00:21,155
bagaimana mungkin,

16
00:00:21,175 --> 00:00:22,501
tak pernah ada laki-laki yang

17
00:00:22,521 --> 00:00:23,279
menyentuhku?

18
00:00:23,299 --> 00:00:23,852
Jawabnya:

19
00:00:23,872 --> 00:00:25,425
hal itu mudah bagi-Ku,

20
00:00:25,445 --> 00:00:27,251
dan ia akan menjadi tanda bagi

21
00:00:27,271 --> 00:00:28,752
