22
00:00:28,772 --> 00:00:29,619
Ia mengandung,

23
00:00:29,639 --> 00:00:30,749
lalu menjauh ke tempat yang

24
00:00:30,769 --> 00:00:31,791
terpencil.

25
00:00:31,811 --> 00:00:33,107
Saat rasa sakit melahirkan

26
00:00:33,127 --> 00:00:34,717
datang, ia bersandar di

27
00:00:34,737 --> 00:00:36,017
pangkal pohon kurma dan

28
00:00:36,037 --> 00:00:36,702
berkata:

29
00:00:36,722 --> 00:00:37,755
alangkah baiknya aku mati

30
00:00:37,775 --> 00:00:38,448
