31
00:00:38,468 --> 00:00:40,027
Lalu ia diseru dari tempat

32
00:00:40,047 --> 00:00:40,817
yang rendah:

33
00:00:40,837 --> 00:00:41,931
janganlah engkau bersedih

34
00:00:41,951 --> 00:00:42,398
hati.

35
00:00:42,418 --> 00:00:43,993
Tuhanmu telah menjadikan anak

36
00:00:44,013 --> 00:00:44,988
sungai di bawahmu.

37
00:00:45,008 --> 00:00:46,204
Dan goyanglah pangkal pohon

38
00:00:46,224 --> 00:00:47,380
kurma itu ke arahmu,

39
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:48,944
niscaya ia menggugurkan kurma

40
00:00:48,964 --> 00:00:49,813
