41
00:00:49,833 --> 00:00:50,772
Maka makan,

42
00:00:50,792 --> 00:00:52,305
minum, dan bersenanghatilah

43
00:00:52,325 --> 00:00:52,837
engkau.

44
00:00:52,857 --> 00:00:54,393
Banyak ulama mengambil

45
00:00:54,413 --> 00:00:56,031
pelajaran dari sini:

46
00:00:56,051 --> 00:00:57,378
pohon kurma tak akan bergoyang

47
00:00:57,398 --> 00:00:58,508
oleh tenaga seorang perempuan

48
00:00:58,528 --> 00:00:59,228
