49
00:00:59,248 --> 00:01:00,250
Tapi ia tetap diminta

50
00:01:00,270 --> 00:01:01,852
bergerak, dan pertolongan

51
00:01:01,872 --> 00:01:02,569
datang setelahnya.

52
00:01:02,589 --> 00:01:04,268
Pertolongan datang,

53
00:01:04,288 --> 00:01:05,739
tapi kita tetap diminta

54
00:01:05,759 --> 00:01:06,614
melangkah.

55
00:01:06,634 --> 00:01:07,899
Usaha kecil apa yang sedang

56
00:01:07,919 --> 00:01:08,828
kamu tunda?

57
00:01:08,848 --> 00:01:10,004
Kisah dalam Al-Qur'an,

58
00:01:10,024 --> 00:01:11,168
bersama AUDIRA.

